5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We need a sustainable system. Before we decide, we should look at the actual time and effort required for these chores.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I agree! It feels like some of us are doing more than others lately. Let's find out what's actually happening.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,Harmony is the priority. I want to ensure we choose a method that prevents resentment from building up over the year.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know about the money! Who's buying the soap and sponges? Let's check the receipts and the costs!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just want the rooms to be consistently clean. I'll look into why the state of the rooms changes so much.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I'll check the ""Stopwatch timing of a full pass"" and ""Standard terms of the outside firm"" to see the labor involved.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I'm going for ""Absences on the wall calendar"" and ""A fortnight's watch on kitchen use"" to see who's actually here.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I will examine the ""Rows recorded in the house chat"" and the ""Note left by the previous tenants"" to avoid past mistakes.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I'll take ""Bathroom spray stock and the tin's receipts"" and ""Management office rate sheet and billing""! I'm on the money trail!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll look at ""What each housemate counts as done"" and ""Bathroom grout after the July scrub.""","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
